3. Create a `Dispatcher` that accepts raw event data, routes it to the correct processor and performs any necessary transformations or enrichments. 
```java
@Service
public class Dispatcher {
    private final Map<String, EventProcessor> processors;

    @Autowired
    public Dispatcher(List<EventProcessor> processors) {
        this.processors = processors.stream().collect(Collectors.toMap(p -> p.getClass().getName(), Function.identity()));
    }

    public void dispatch(RawEvent rawEvent) {
        EventProcessor processor = processors.get(rawEvent.getSource());
        if (processor != null) {
            processor.process(new Event(rawEvent));
        } else {
            throw new IllegalArgumentException("Unknown event source: " + rawEvent.getSource());
        }
    }
}
```
