["This is a complex task which requires in-depth knowledge of multiple components such as event sourcing, scalability patterns, error handling, etc. However, I will provide an outline of how you could tackle this problem using Java.

Here is the high-level architecture for your system:

```java
public class EventDrivenSystem {
    private DataSource dataSource; // Source of all events
    private EventProcessor eventProcessor;  // Processes and handles events
    private ErrorHandler errorHandler;  // Handles any errors during processing

    public void startProcessing() {
        while (true) { // run indefinitely
            try {
                // Fetch next batch of events
                List<Event> events = dataSource.fetchEvents();

                for (Event event : events) {
                    try {
                        eventProcessor.process(event);  // process the event
                    } catch (Exception e) {
                        errorHandler.handleError(e, event);  // handle any errors
                    }
                }
            } catch (InterruptedException e) {
                Thread.currentThread().interrupt(); // restore interrupted status
                break;
            }
        }
    }
}
```

